            "review_title": "Review at Citrus Coffee",
            "review_text": "Nguyễn Minh Thư Đ\n2 contributions\n0\nThe true essence of Vietnamese coffee!\nJan 2025 • Friends\nThe staff is friendly and knowledgeable, eager to share the story behind each coffee blend. What truly sets Citrus Coffee apart is their commitment to sourcing high-quality coffee beans from local Vietnamese farms. Whether you’re a die-hard coffee enthusiast or a casual drinker, this café offers a delightful Vietnamese coffee culture.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 6, 2025",
